# =============================================================================
# Restricted licensed source data (NDA / data-use agreement)
# The Alaska DMV crash extracts are licensed and must never enter version
# control or any public package. Spreadsheet sources are ignored wholesale as a
# fail-closed default: no spreadsheet in this project is intentionally public
# (the approved public evidence ships as de-identified parquet/JSON via the
# verified release package). A deliberate exception would require `git add -f`
# plus a documented privacy review.
# =============================================================================
